# Instagram Graph API (optional - leave blank to skip Instagram posting)
# Posting is skipped gracefully and postURL is stored empty when these are unset.
#
# How to obtain (see server/INSTAGRAM_SETUP.md for full steps):
#  1. Convert the IG account to Business/Creator and link it to a Facebook Page.
#  2. Create a Meta app at https://developers.facebook.com/ and add the
#     Instagram Graph API product.
#  3. Request permissions: instagram_business_basic,
#     instagram_business_content_publish (needs App Review for production).
#  4. Generate a long-lived (60-day) User access token -> IG_ACCESS_TOKEN.
#  5. Get the IG Business Account ID -> IG_USER_ID via:
#     GET https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/{page-id}
#         ?fields=instagram_business_account&access_token={token}
# NOTE: the long-lived token expires after 60 days and must be refreshed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
